{
    "background_story": "Kelvin was a brilliant and eccentric music producer who idolized the legendary audio equipment manufacturer, Steinberg. Growing up, he spent hours in his makeshift home studio, experimenting with sounds and techniques. Kelvin's big break came when he was commissioned to create a soundtrack for a high-profile video game. He poured his heart and soul into the project, using his prized Steinberg audio interface to craft an immersive and haunting score. The game's success catapulted Kelvin to fame, and he became known for his unique sonic signature. He continued to push the boundaries of music production, always seeking new ways to innovate and collaborate with other artists. Kelvin's love affair with Steinberg equipment remained a constant source of inspiration throughout his career.",
